Error [E0120]: `resource` was not moved here, so it cannot fill an owned field
  --> tests/ui/single_use_dropped.jet:7:28
    |
  7 |     return Lock.{resource: resource}
    |                            ^^^^^^^^
 Why: this function has read access only and does not own the value
 Fix: copy it explicitly with `~resource`

Error [E0140]: `db` still owes `consume`
  --> tests/ui/single_use_dropped.jet:15:5
    |
 15 |     db :: acquire("db")
    |     ^^
 Why: this value's type is `#SingleUse`, so it carries a job that has to be done — dropping it without doing that job leaves the work undone (an unjoined task, an unreleased lock)
 Fix: consume it exactly once: move it to a `^` parameter, or `return` it — or write `#Unsafe("reason") { consume(db) }` to discard it deliberately
